# Title: Suspicious Network Command
# ID: a29c1813-ab1f-4dde-b489-330b952e91ae
# Status: test
# Level: low
# Author: frack113, Christopher Peacock '@securepeacock', SCYTHE '@scythe_io'
# Date: 2021-12-07
# Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1016
# Description: Adversaries may look for details about the network configuration and settings of systems they access or through information discovery of remote systems
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((regex process_exec="(?i)ipconfig\\s+/all" OR regex process_exec="(?i)netsh\\s+interface show interface" OR regex process_exec="(?i)arp\\s+-a" OR regex process_exec="(?i)nbtstat\\s+-n" OR regex process_exec="(?i)net\\s+config" OR regex process_exec="(?i)route\\s+print"))
